export anchor GamifiedStyle:
    number: 21
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Gamified
    idea: Productivity as a friendly game, with XP bars, level badges, a streak counter and achievement chips in bold purple, orange and green on white.
    base: light
    palette:
        white: #ffffff, the page and cards
        lilac: #f3effc, the XP track, the active tab and avatar tiles
        lilac2: #e2d9f8, the XP track rim, last week's bars and the secondary button edge
        line: #e4e0ef, 3px card outlines and the quest card press edge
        purple: #6d28d9, XP fill, level badges, links and this week's bars
        purpleDark: #4c1d95, the focus halo and chart value labels
        green: #15803d, the go button and the top level badge, with a #0d5a2a press edge
        orange: #c2410c, the streak number and notification count, with #8a2e08 text on #ffedd5
        gold: #facc15 with #422006 text, the score chip and the focus ring
        red: #b91c1c on #fee2e2, the overdue cards and the Behind tag
        text: #1e1b2e, body text, with #565166 for muted text
    type:
        ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Arial Rounded MT Bold, Varela Round,
        Nunito, Trebuchet MS, system-ui, sans-serif. Weights are heavy,
        900 for headings and numbers and 600 for body. The score is 44px,
        the greeting 30px, section titles 22px, quest names 18px, body
        15px, tags 13px. Buttons are 15px uppercase with 0.02em tracking.
    layout:
        A top bar with a hexagon lightning logo, six icon tabs, a search,
        a bell with a count bubble and the avatar, kept on one line on wide
        screens. Below it three columns. The left player column holds the
        greeting card, an orange streak card with a flame and 14 day
        streak, a red overdue card and a two by two grid of summary stats.
        The centre quest board shows six project cards in two columns,
        each with a hexagon level badge, an XP bar, task count and status
        tag, plus a green New project button. The right column holds the
        chart card and a team feed with achievement chips. Below 1240px the
        right column moves under the others, and below 640px all is one
        column with tabs as a three by two grid.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px between quest cards, 18 to 20px card padding and 24px page gutters.
    density: Medium. Three columns, chunky controls and every number big and bold.
    corners: 24px on cards, 16px on buttons and rows, 14px on fields and tabs, hexagons for level badges.
    borders: 3px solid #e4e0ef on every card, field and tab. Status tags use a 2px tinted rim.
    shadows: No blur. Solid offset press edges, 0 5px 0 a darker shade under buttons and 0 6px 0 #e4e0ef under quest cards.
    icons:
        22px chunky filled icons. Level badges are 52 by 58 hexagons with
        LV over the level, which is the tens digit of the percent done.
        Status tags show a star for On track, a triangle with an
        exclamation mark for At risk and a circle with a down arrow for
        Behind. Each feed item earns a small achievement chip such as Task
        done, Team player, Level up, New quests, Deep focus or Delivered.
        Chart bars are rounded with the value printed on top.
    focus: A 4px gold outline offset 2px, ringed by a 7px dark purple halo.
    tone: Upbeat and playful but plain, such as Let’s go, Mara!, Quest board, 14 day streak and +14 on last week, with uppercase buttons.
